#EXTINF:-1 group-title="ARTE Concert - Metal" tvg-id="2043246394" tvg-name="Noch bevor es das Genre Death Metal gab‚ gab es Possessed. Die Death-Metal-Pioniere zementieren beim Hellfest ihren Legendenstatus. <br/>From 22.06.2026 01:18" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="German" channel-id="ARTE.DE",Possessed - Hellfest 2026 (Originalversion) (22.06.2026)
